{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"864","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Bus"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A bus moves along the coordinate line "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"Ox"},{"kind":"text","text":" from the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":". After starting from the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":", it reaches the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":", immediately turns back and then moves to the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":". After returning to the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" it immediately goes back to the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and so on. Thus, the bus moves from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and back. Moving from the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":" or from the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" is called a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bus journey"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". In total, the bus must make "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" journeys."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The petrol tank of the bus can hold "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters of gasoline. To pass a single unit of distance the bus needs to spend exactly one liter of gasoline. The bus starts its first journey with a full petrol tank."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a gas station in point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = f"},{"kind":"text","text":". This point is between points "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = a"},{"kind":"text","text":". There are no other gas stations on the bus route. While passing by a gas station in either direction the bus can stop and completely refuel its tank. Thus, after stopping to refuel the tank will contain "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters of gasoline."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the minimum number of times the bus needs to refuel at the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = f"},{"kind":"text","text":" to make "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" journeys? The first journey starts in the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains four integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 < f < a ≤ 106"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ b ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the endpoint of the first bus journey, the capacity of the fuel tank of the bus, the point where the gas station is located, and the required number of journeys."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the minimum number of times the bus needs to refuel to make "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" journeys. If it is impossible for the bus to make "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" journeys, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 9 2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 10 2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 5 4 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example the bus needs to refuel during each journey."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example the bus can pass "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of distance without refueling. So the bus makes the whole first journey, passes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of the distance of the second journey and arrives at the point with the gas station. Then it can refuel its tank, finish the second journey and pass "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of distance from the third journey. In this case, it will again arrive at the point with the gas station. Further, he can refill the tank up to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters to finish the third journey and ride all the way of the fourth journey. At the end of the journey the tank will be empty. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example the bus can not make all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" journeys because if it refuels during the second journey, the tanks will contain only "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters of gasoline, but the bus needs to pass "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" units of distance until next refueling."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"864C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/864/problem/C"}